      "page": 2,
      "text": "CONTROLLED-REPLAY: S03 lighting was the sole manipulated variable in a synthetic simulator. Three identical simulated lots were replayed in a blinded ABAB crossover. Exposure stayed at 2400 microseconds. Labels, alignment, product and thresholds were held fixed. At 600 lux false rejects were 100 per 10000; at 300 lux they were 1400 per 10000. Restoring 600 lux restored 100 per 10000 in every replay. This controlled intervention",
